corona-gerboa-engineer: the Council's Systems Technician (avatar of the Corona).
A member of the Council as a giant jerboa systems engineer (scale 20 vpt, base anatomy with ears forward).
A dark plum/slate coat enriched by technological lavender spots and mottling, with a soft lilac-cream bib and belly.
It wears a hi-tech engine driver's cap with a visor in purple technical fabric (#78348c and #b9a6ff, the heraldic colour of the Engineer)
with a bright lavender neon edge on the rim of the visor (glow="True"), shaped between the ears with tailored anatomical slits;
over the right eye drops a showy precision optical monocle with a round chrome ring, a lavender holographic lens (glow="True")
and a bright central reticle; a small titanium headband earpiece circling the base of the right ear with a small boom
microphone over the muzzle; a technical ribbon collar with a logical systems badge at the neck, a tool belt with a diagnostic scanner
at the left side with a lavender holographic display (glow="True"), and a spectacular tail plume with a soft lavender puff.
Box: 1.6 × 2.2 × 2.1 tiles, 32 × 44 × 42 voxels, 20 voxels per tile (vpt: 20).
Role: npc.
-->
